  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 is a breaking release: custom exceptions moved to Isaac.FileStorage.CustomExceptions, and KeyNotFoundException was renamed to StorageKeyNotFoundException to avoid colliding with System.Collections.Generic.KeyNotFoundException. Automatic migration of legacy pre-0.3 .jk files is no longer performed. A path-traversal vulnerability in key handling was fixed (keys can no longer escape the storage directory; invalid keys throw InvalidKeyException). Insert, Get, and Delete now consistently wrap unexpected failures in InvalidOperationException with the original exception preserved as InnerException. Retargeted to net10.0.",
